OL,3,GNEWSASmith & Nephew fined after driver
OL,4,Ais seriously hurt
OL,5,
OL,6,FSmith & Nephew Medical has been fined
OL,7,F#230,000 after a delivery driver
OL,8,Fsuffered life-changing injuries when a
OL,9,F1.2-tonne crate fell from a forklift
OL,10,Ftruck.
OL,12,FThe company was found guilty on 12
OL,13,FSeptember of failing to ensure the
OL,14,Fhealth and safety of a non-employee.
OL,16,FThe driver, who was delivering an
OL,17,Felectron microscope for Nippon Express,
OL,18,Fwas seriously injured, according to the
OL,19,FHealth and Safety Executive (HSE).
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
