OL,3,GNEWSASmith & Nephew fined after driver
OL,4,Ais seriously hurt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Smith & Nephew spokesperson said the
OL,7,FHull-based company had "fully reviewed"
OL,8,Fits offloading processes and had worked
OL,9,Fwith the HSE to adopt best practices at
OL,10,Fall its sites.
